						<r3d:remarks>ICGEM is one of six centres of the International Gravity Field Service (IGFS) of the  International Association of Geodesy (IAG). 
The other five Centres are 
Bureau Gravimetrique International (BGI) at CNES / CRGS, Toulouse, France 
Digital Elevation Model Centre (DEM) at Montfort University, UK 
International Centre for Earth Tides (ICET) at University of French Polynesia 
International Geoid Service (IGeS) at Politecnico di Milano, Milan, Italy 
Technical Support Centre of IGFS at NGA, Saint Louis, USA</r3d:remarks>
